{\pard\f0\fs15\li576 A. Jesus said it to Nicodemus (John 3:3)\par}
{\pard\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576\fi-576\tx576 Q\tab 8. Quote John, chapter 3, verse 3.\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576 A. "Jesus replied, \u8220?Very truly I tell you, no one can see the kingdom of God unless they are born again.\u8221?" (John 3:3)\par}
{\pard\par}
