{\pard\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576\fi-576\tx576 Q\tab 12. Quote John, chapter 3, verses 5 through 6.\par}
{\pard\f0\fs15\li576 A. "Jesus answered, \u8220?Very truly I tell you, no one can enter the kingdom of God unless they are born of water and the Spirit.  Flesh gives birth to flesh, but the Spirit gives birth to spirit." (John 3:5-6)\par}
{\pard\par}
